[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5397327736","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120292#issuecomment-5397327736","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120292","id":5397327736,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQbSveA","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T15:17:42Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T15:17:42Z","body":"Did you test the fix? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5397327736/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5734621221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120292#issuecomment-5734621221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120292","id":5734621221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVc9gJQ","user":{"login":"Spacexcx","id":175117217,"node_id":"U_kgDOCnAToQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175117217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx","html_url":"https://github.com/Spacexcx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Spacexcx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T18:44:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T22:40:45Z","body":"Looking at the shader generation in `particle_process_material.cpp`:\r\n\r\nBecause this is inside the per-frame `process()` block rather than the emission/`start()` block, extracting the scale into `params.scale` every frame will cause compounding/exponential scaling over time when `PARTICLE_FLAG_ALIGN_Y_TO_VELOCITY` is disabled (since `TRANSFORM` retains its scale and is never normalized in that branch). Each frame will multiply the previous frame's scaled transform length into `params.scale`.\r\n\r\nIf the goal is to retain the scale from `EMIT_FLAG_ROTATION_SCALE` (per #119920), that scale extraction likely needs to happen in `start()` upon emission, or the transform basis needs to be explicitly normalized each step before applying the final scale.\r\n\r\n*(Caught this while testing a local pre-push risk checker [pr-check](https://github.com/Spacexcx/pr-check) on open PR diffs, and confirmed the shader logic manually).*","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5734621221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"low-quality"}}]